{"id":"steam-832370","steam":832370,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Cubekiller","summary":"CubeKiller is a 3D Indie third-person singleplayer game that allows you to fight and survive, unravel and shape your own story in CubeKiller","about":"CubeKiller is a 3D Indie third-person game that allows you to play as a cube and fight enemies of different shapes and sizes.\r\n\r\nYour actions in-game will affect the outcome of the story, unravel the story behind CubeKiller, all in your own way.\r\n\r\nFun modes await you! Custom matches, endless survival, out-numbered hardcore, and much more! Fight either by yourself or with your team for the victory!\r\n\r\n\nFeatures\n\r\n\r\n\n• Gameplay based multi-storyline campaign\r\n• Endless Mode\r\n• Custom Matches\r\n• Hardcore Mode\n\r\n\r\n\nDevelopment Plan\n\r\n\r\nCubeKiller is an Early Access game, more modes will be added and better gameplay will be improved throughout the development stage.\r\n\r\n\n• Custom Map Support\r\n• Steam Workshop Integration\r\n• Squads\r\n• Huge Open-World Explore Mode\r\n• Spectator Command, lead your team to victory!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/832370/portrait.png?t=1587346370","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/832370/header.jpg?t=1587346370","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/832370/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1587346370","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/832370/header.jpg?t=1587346370","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/832370/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1587346370","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/832370/ss_906f8531ba46454bc20e038046ccb09da6f0a736.600x338.jpg?t=1587346370","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/832370/ss_906f8531ba46454bc20e038046ccb09da6f0a736.jpg?t=